OL,3,GNEWSAWoman locked girl in home before
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been jailed after luring a
OL,7,Fvulnerable teenage schoolgirl to her
OL,8,Fhome, locking her in and subjecting her
OL,9,Fto a serious sexual assault.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said on 10
OL,12,FMarch, Karen Murerwa persuaded the
OL,13,Fvictim to come into her house in Seaton
OL,14,FCrescent, Nottingham, gave her alcohol,
OL,15,Ftook her phone and made her send a
OL,16,Fmessage to her mum saying she was with
OL,17,Fa friend.
OL,19,FShe was then taken upstairs and
OL,20,Fsubjected to a sustained assault before
OL,21,Feventually being let out of the house.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
