OL,3,GNEWSAWoman locked girl in home before
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FMurerwa, who pleaded guilty to two
OL,7,Fcounts of sexual assault by penetration
OL,8,Fand a further count of false
OL,9,Fimprisonment, was jailed for six years
OL,10,Fand four months at Nottingham Crown
OL,11,FCourt on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
